message: >-
  Cite this software and the corresponding UniARC manuscript when using this
  repository. The supplied manuscript is anonymous; final paper authors,
  venue metadata, and DOI must be confirmed before adding a preferred citation.
type: software
title: 'UniARC: Unified Audio Representation Comparison'
authors:
  - name: UniARC contributors
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Unified source distribution for the two evaluation strategies in
  Discrete vs. Continuous: A Comprehensive Study of Unified Audio Understanding
  in LALMs: XARES-LLM-based parameter-efficient fine-tuning and frozen-backbone
  probing.
keywords:
  - audio understanding
  - audio language models
  - representation learning
